<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79996" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰτάνη</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[τᾰ]</span>, ἡ, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flat
			dish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.107
			</span></i> :—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάτᾰνον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.90
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> :—
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰτάνιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				38
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				47
			</span></i> ; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾰτᾰνίων</span></b>  is
			the name of a cook in <i><span class="en">
				Philetaer.
				14
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>. —For the Sicil. forms <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰτάνη</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰτά̆γ-ιον</span></b> , v. sub vocc.</div>
